B.bbY=s(['Pour une action termin\xe9e et dat\xe9e (yesterday, last week, in 2026), utilisez le Past Simple : "I worked", "I went", "I bought".','Pi\xe8ge n\xb01 : apr\xe8s DID / DIDN\u2019T, le verbe revient TOUJOURS \xe0 la forme de base : "I didn\u2019t go" (jamais "didn\u2019t went").',"Apprenez en priorit\xe9 les irr\xe9guliers du quotidien : go\u2192went, buy\u2192bought, speak\u2192spoke, take\u2192took, write\u2192wrote, think\u2192thought."],t.s)
