B.azA=s(["IN (large : mois, ann\xe9es, saisons, villes, moments) : in 2026, in Dakar, in the morning.","ON (jours & dates pr\xe9cis) : on Monday, on July 4th, on the weekend.","AT (heures exactes & lieux pr\xe9cis) : at 8:00 AM, at night, at work, at university.","DO = t\xe2ches & devoirs (do homework, do research, do your best) \u2022 MAKE = cr\xe9er/d\xe9cider (make a decision, make progress, make a mistake)."],t.s)
