B.b67=s(["Structure STAR en 60\u201390s : S (Contexte bref) \u2192 T (Votre mission) \u2192 A (Verbes d\u2019action concrets : led, designed, streamlined) \u2192 R (R\xe9sultat chiffr\xe9).","\xc9vitez le vague \xab I helped with... \xbb : utilisez \xab I spearheaded... \xbb, \xab I coordinated... \xbb, \xab I reduced latency by 35% \xbb.","Terminez par la le\xe7on apprise ou l\u2019impact durable pour l\u2019\xe9quipe."],t.s)
B.aaH=new A.dj("We made a big project and it was very good. \u274c","I coordinated a cross-functional project that cut delivery time by 25%. \u2705","Un verbe pr\xe9cis + un chiffre concret multiplient la cr\xe9dibilit\xe9 en entretien.")
