B.bf_=s(['Quand un adverbe restrictif ou n\xe9gatif ouvre la phrase, on inverse auxiliaire + sujet : "Not only did we cut costs, we also improved quality."','Conditionnel 3 \xe9l\xe9gant sans "if" : "Had we tested earlier, we would have spotted the flaw."','Mise en relief naturelle (cleft sentences) : "What matters most is consistency", "It was teamwork that made the difference."'],t.s)
