B.b4V=s(['Conc\xe9der intelligemment avant de contre-argumenter : "Granted, speed matters; however, accuracy comes first."','Poser une condition pr\xe9cise : "Provided that learners verify sources, AI accelerates mastery."','Conclure avec hauteur : "On balance, the benefits outweigh the risks."'],t.s)
